      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Krea 2 Rotate + Outpaint\n\nTurn, crop and pad a picture, and Krea 2 paints the new area. By AusBoss.\n\n[▶ AusBoss on YouTube](https://www.youtube.com/@ausbossdev) · videos on these nodes and workflows\n\n---\n\n1. Load your image. A new image resets the turn, crop and padding.\n2. Turn it with the round handle, drag the crop edges in, and drag the orange handles out to pad.\n3. Press **Run**.\n4. To steer the new area, say what belongs there in **What goes there**.\n\nOn one side, add at most about half your picture's size per run, or add to both sides. More on one side can paint a second scene.\n\nPad with **Pad Image for Outpainting** (left, top, right, bottom, in pixels) and turn in quarter turns with **Rotate Image**: the AusBoss handles for free rotation and cropping are not part of this copy.\n\n**LatentCrate changes** (modified clone of the MIT copy in [ausboss/ComfyUI-AusBoss @9986ded](https://github.com/ausboss/ComfyUI-AusBoss/blob/9986ded1096db8dae04ccb9bc7e3e2ac382472cd/example_workflows/Krea%202%20Rotate%20%2B%20Outpaint%20%28AusBoss%29.json)), so it runs without the AusBoss pack:\n\n- Image Crop + Rotate + Pad → Load Image, Rotate Image, Pad Image for Outpainting (grey fill, feathering 32, as the AusBoss feather), then Scale Image to Total Pixels (1.5 MP, steps 16) with Resize Image/Mask matching the mask to it: the padded canvas, not your picture alone, gets the 1.5 MP budget. Free-angle rotation, crop, and the median-colour refill of the reference are lost.\n- Krea 2 Encode → krea2edit grounded encode (the canvas through Qwen3-VL) + Reference Latent of the full-resolution encoded canvas + Edit Model Reference Method `index_timestep_zero`, with an empty CLIP Text Encode as negative.\n- Krea 2 Outpaint Model Patch (whole canvas) → none: core Krea 2 places the reference on frame 1 aligned with the canvas.\n- Stitch Inpaint (blend in) → Image Composite Masked of the canvas over the result through the inverted pad mask; tone matching is lost.\n- LoRA Loader → Load LoRA (model only); Seed → the KSampler seed; Text → String (Multiline); Show Text → Preview Any; Compare → Compare Images; Save Image → Save Image; Run Timer and the workflow card removed; both subgraphs flattened.\n- Krea 2 Turbo fp8 → the shipped int8 build (`krea2-int8`).\n\n**Models and nodes:** model sets `krea2-int8` and `krea2-utilities` (AnyPaint); node set `krea2-nodes` (krea2edit)."
      ],
      "title": "Krea 2 Rotate + Outpaint (AusBoss)"
    },
